amination indicate a high degree of accuracy and data quality."},{"id":"c16","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_bcf8892d3cc03b86","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":3,"quote":"The accuracy of the retrieval evaluator undeniably plays a pivotal role in shaping the overall system performance, as it influences the outcomes of subsequent processes."},{"id":"c17","chunkId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031_c_95bf4a60b92e659e","docId":"975aa1fd3c1b6031","docTitle":"2401.15884_Corrective_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":8,"quote":"Ambiguous 48.1 61.5 Table 2: Ablation study for removing each single action on the PopQA dataset in terms of accuracy."},{"id":"c18","chunkId":"d2068edc08df316d_c_5fd5dca923d6d3cf","docId":"d2068edc08df316d","docTitle":"Siren's Song in the AI Ocean: A Survey on Hallucination in Large Language Models","page":11,"quote":"LLMs sometimes overestimate their capacities Some studies have been conducted with the aim of understanding whether language models can assess the accuracy of their responses and rec- ognize their knowledge boundaries."},{"id":"c19","chunkId":"743155d9b0541c99_c_23c79895493f4fa2","docId":"743155d9b0541c99","docTitle":"2401.15391_MultiHop_RAG_Benchmarking_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Multi_Hop","page":7,"quote":"Open source LLM such as Llama02-70B and Mixtral-8x7B only achieve an accuracy of 0.32 and 0.36 respectively."},{"id":"c20","chunkId":"3a2ca388b4a2fb17_c_dbccbb37e009316a","docId":"3a2ca388b4a2fb17","docTitle":"2304.09542_Is_ChatGPT_Good_at_Search_Investigating_Large_Language_Models_as_Re_Ra","page":7,"quote":"We suggest two explanations: First, from the result that PG has significantly higher top-1 accuracy compared to other methods, we infer that LLMs can explicitly compare multiple passages with PG, allowing subtle differences between"},{"id":"c21","chunkId":"ac529ab762fd1672_c_7fe9bfdcfda00a90","docId":"ac529ab762fd1672","docTitle":"HybridRAG: Integrating Knowledge Gr